>If those extended logics use the same formalism of FOPL, then their formul=
as can be directly and automatically translated into Lojban (but without us=
ing Lojban's "shortcuts", of course). If they each use a different particul=
ar syntax, then they may not have an automatic translation into Lojban, or =
at least each case would have to be analysed separately to see how it can b=
e accommodated. I don't think it's reasonable to expect Lojban to automatic=
ally translate every formalism ever used though.=20
>=20
