>A lot of work needs to be done to explain how Lojban's "shortcuts", and it=
s "bells and whistles", translate into something that can be called "logica=
l". If that's what you're saying, I agree. What I thought you were saying, =
but perhaps you were not, is that you had doubts that Lojban would have any=
 trouble expressing FOPL. That part is trivial.
